Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.28,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&\fs40}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.29,0:00:11.19,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I'm a soldier - that means I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.39,0:00:14.59,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Both a defendant and the judge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:19.99,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I am standing on both ends of the flame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.67,0:00:24.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Rounding curves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.97,0:00:27.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Overtaking life and death,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.17,0:00:33.57,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I run and fight with false shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.87,0:00:40.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,No matter how many threads of\Ndeception are woven together,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.57,0:00:48.07,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,The truth shall illuminate the face of light
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.07,0:00:51.87,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your tears for the day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.17,0:00:55.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,when our pain is far behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.57,0:00:58.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,on your feet, come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.47,0:01:01.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We are soldiers stand or die
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.97,0:01:04.87,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your fears, take your place
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.07,0:01:08.07,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save them for the judgement day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.37,0:01:11.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,fast and free, follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.57,0:01:16.57,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Time to make the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.77,0:01:22.37,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We rise or fall
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.61,0:02:11.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}Prime Minister Kayabuki has just welcomed\NSecretary of State Schroeder with a handshake.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.41,0:02:17.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}The American Empire has been demonstrating its authority\Nas a military state since the last great war.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.41,0:02:20.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}However, as it now suffers\Nfrom a collapsed economy,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.71,0:02:24.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}Japan is taking the initiative in seeking a common\Nground for the renegotiation of the security pact{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.11,0:02:29.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}by inviting the Secretary of State to\Nits territory, in a strong-arm tactic.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.01,0:02:32.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}However, since the Japanese government also\Nsuffers from many serious domestic problems{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.91,0:02:38.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}such as an unstable economy,\Ndelays in refugee policy, and the Article 9 issue,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.01,0:02:43.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}the intensification of protests\Nfrom many areas is unavoidable.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.81,0:02:47.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You shouldn't watch that crap, even during a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.21,0:02:50.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't take it out on them\Njust because you're losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.21,0:02:52.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, look who's talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.71,0:02:58.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This time, it's all me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.72,0:03:11.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.61,0:03:19.11,Sign - Copy,,600,0,600,,{\b1}Beware the \N Left Eye{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.01,0:03:25.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, hey. Why do we still have to\Nbother with security relationships?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.01,0:03:28.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Japan has a military, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.61,0:03:31.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The current regime is very hawkish,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.51,0:03:34.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but since the American\NEmpire's economy is battered,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.41,0:03:38.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,they'd like to renew the security pact\Nnow, while they have the upper hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.01,0:03:42.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I guess they want to redeem themselves for the\Nhumiliation they suffered during the last century.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.11,0:03:44.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What humiliation?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.41,0:03:48.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, to put it simply, they lost the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.51,0:03:53.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Besides, there's that uncertain item in the Constitution\Nknown as Article 9, which is still in effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.71,0:03:56.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,meaning that the Self-Defence Force\Ncan't take preemptive actions overseas
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.51,0:03:58.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and that they can't have nuclear weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.31,0:04:02.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The last security pact made in the\Nprevious century functioned well,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.81,0:04:05.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,despite the fact that the agreement was\Nreached at the cost of Japan's pride,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.61,0:04:08.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,due to the tacit agreement that America should\Nfunction as the sword and Japan as the shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.81,0:04:13.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But now that a new enemy,\Nthe economy, has come into view,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.41,0:04:18.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,this new agreement is based on the two countries\Nwanting to cover each other's weaknesses, I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.61,0:04:21.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Wow, you're really mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.41,0:04:23.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let me synchronise with that data.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.71,0:04:24.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sure, I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.41,0:04:27.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I said, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.51,0:04:30.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's right. This is a serious game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.31,0:04:31.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Stay quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.61,0:04:33.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Aw, not you too, Azuma-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.71,0:04:36.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Aren't you being a bit\Ntoo cocky for a newcomer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.01,0:04:40.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't take it out on others\Njust because you're losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.31,0:04:41.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.21,0:04:43.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll turn the tables on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.21,0:04:45.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I raise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.03,0:04:51.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll raise, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.53,0:04:53.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's the ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.57,0:05:00.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,When it comes down to it,\Npoker is a game of chance;
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.37,0:05:02.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,why does Saitou-San always win?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.47,0:05:06.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's been bothering me for a while, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.07,0:05:08.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In particular, under the current rules of the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.87,0:05:11.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,all you have to do is to memorise everyone's cards
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.17,0:05:15.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and predict their hand from\Ntheir first and last cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:18.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Saitou-San shouldn't be winning every time,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.47,0:05:21.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but for some reason,\Nhe takes all the chips in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.17,0:05:23.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's just good at bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.17,0:05:26.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll tear that front of yours down soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.97,0:05:28.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah, he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.47,0:05:30.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's called having a poker face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.57,0:05:31.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.17,0:05:33.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You guys can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.37,0:05:40.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Compared to the game of life and\Ndeath, poker is child's play.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.37,0:05:42.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,TouchÃ©
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.37,0:05:45.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll acknowledge that\Nyou're a top notch sniper,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.67,0:05:48.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but comparing poker to sniping\Nstill won't hold water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.23,0:05:54.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Once, I was in a one-on-one sniping duel
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.73,0:05:57.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,with someone who had me scared shitless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.63,0:06:02.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'd never feared a battle of\Nwits as I did in that match.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.63,0:06:08.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ever since that match,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.93,0:06:11.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've been able to predict\Nthe thoughts of most people
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.23,0:06:13.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,with a single glance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.33,0:06:16.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I find that hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.83,0:06:19.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,By the way, what kind of\Nopponent was that person?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.03,0:06:21.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You want me to tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.13,0:06:22.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.86,0:06:30.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll talk if everyone calls me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:38.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's not that I want to hear your story.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:40.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't get me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.11,0:06:47.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It was in the summer of 2020.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.71,0:06:51.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Eurasia was preoccupied with\Na futile war of attrition.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.11,0:06:54.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I was sick of Japan,\Nwhich was enjoying an extra-punitive
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.97,0:06:58.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,isolationist policy amidst\Nthe strange political balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.77,0:07:03.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'd joined the Red Bianco as a mercenary,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.57,0:07:06.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,a volunteer corps supporting\Nthe interim Mexican government.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.07,0:07:11.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,At the time, my left eye was still\Nsafe and sound in its socket,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.43,0:07:23.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oil from the Middle East,\Ndrugs from South America:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.03,0:07:27.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,conflict is a given in areas\Nwhere a vested interest arises.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.33,0:07:32.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The American Empire, divided and\Nexhausted from the previous world war,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.63,0:07:38.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,was beginning to seriously consider\Neradicating the new continent's drug market
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.23,0:07:40.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to prevent the outflow of their national budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.73,0:07:44.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Under the pretext of overthrowing\Nthe corrupt Mexican government,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.83,0:07:46.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the American Empire incited the United Nations
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.03,0:07:50.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to deploy the UN troops, consisting of British\Nand Japanese forces, to South America.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.83,0:07:53.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,First, citing expedited capture\Nof the capital as a reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.83,0:07:55.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,they pushed through carpet-bombing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.93,0:08:02.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Later, they resorted to deploying mechanised troops\Nto Monterrey to sweep up the remaining guerillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.53,0:08:08.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All my comrades were eliminated by the\NUN mechanised troops after the bombing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.13,0:08:11.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Judging that it was time to call it quits,\NI was waiting for a chance to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.83,0:08:13.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It was at that time...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.83,0:08:17.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,that a terminal that had been\Nmonitoring enemy communications
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:20.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,reported that it had discovered enemy special ops\Ntroops in possession of a tactical nuclear device.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.22,0:08:26.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Not having accomplished much\Nof note in battle until then,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.32,0:08:31.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I thought I should work for my\Npay in return for the thrill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.22,0:08:36.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I truly meant to rain terror down on these\Nbastards from God's own vantage point,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:41.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,since they had shown that they had the\Ngall to bring a nuclear device into play.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.53,0:09:05.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.33,0:09:07.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No. It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.41,0:09:18.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.59,0:09:25.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They're too concerned about criticism of\Nattacks on medical organisations and churches;
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.59,0:09:28.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,there are too many remaining nests\Nwhere the guerillas may lurk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.49,0:09:29.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.69,0:09:33.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But there should be two platoons who\Nare sweeping the surviving forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.59,0:09:35.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'd hope that's the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.19,0:09:37.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You guys aren't thorough enough in general.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.29,0:09:42.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Aren't you Brits worshipping the\NSAS legend a bit too much as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.59,0:09:45.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He thinks he's fucking John Rambo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.05,0:09:52.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Bit start.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.80,0:10:03.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.60,0:10:05.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.60,0:10:07.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.00,0:10:15.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sniper!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:16.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.95,0:10:21.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ishikawa, assume that the sniper\Nis using a satellite feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.85,0:10:23.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hack the satellite and\Ndetermine the enemy's location.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.95,0:10:24.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.84,0:10:27.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.24,0:10:28.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Dammit...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.64,0:10:30.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Corporal Mother, please stay still!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.84,0:10:32.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's not using a satellite feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.54,0:10:34.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A long-range jammer is active\Nwithin a one-kilometre radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.24,0:10:38.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Can you determine the enemy's location by\Ntracing the jammer's transmission point?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.10,0:10:39.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm on it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.94,0:10:41.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You guys are efficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.84,0:10:43.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you veterans?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.54,0:10:45.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you have time for chit-chat,\Ngo scout for enemies,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.04,0:10:47.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,you rookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.94,0:10:49.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Which direction did he shoot from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.54,0:10:50.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Were you able to confirm?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.54,0:10:52.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The enemy will hear us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.74,0:10:54.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Switch to cyberbrain comm systems!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.64,0:10:56.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.24,0:10:57.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You'll be surprised at the white noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.84,0:10:58.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.94,0:11:00.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.14,0:11:02.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We couldn't find the enemy at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.24,0:11:04.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We have to treat him as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.04,0:11:06.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, what now, Sergeant?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.24,0:11:12.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ginger, everyone will cover for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.64,0:11:14.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Get Mother out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.04,0:11:16.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Snow, help Ginger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.54,0:11:18.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Damn racist bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.24,0:11:20.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, you Japs!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.64,0:11:22.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Target the west buildings!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.44,0:11:24.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The rest, target the east buildings!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.74,0:11:25.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.48,0:11:33.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't worry. You'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.58,0:11:34.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Think you can make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.78,0:11:35.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.83,0:11:41.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.73,0:11:42.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's in a west building!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.33,0:11:54.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll have to make you guys wonder\Nwhere I am for a bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.39,0:12:00.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Shit in your pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.19,0:12:10.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A 20mm!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.83,0:12:14.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Wait, stop shooting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.83,0:12:15.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.63,0:12:19.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,From which direction was Ginger shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.43,0:12:20.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The west.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.53,0:12:21.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.93,0:12:24.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Didn't you see the car get blown up just now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.43,0:12:25.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The sniper's in the east!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.73,0:12:27.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No, it's more than likely we're surrounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.33,0:12:30.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ishikawa, did you figure out\Nwhere the jamming's coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.53,0:12:32.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Rough estimates, but I have three spots.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.33,0:12:33.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,One's in an east building.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.13,0:12:36.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The other two would be the\Nchurch and the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.93,0:12:38.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Do you think the one in the\Neast building is a decoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.83,0:12:39.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.13,0:12:43.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Before the 20mm was fired, the jamming\Nsignal disappeared for a split second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.73,0:12:46.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Besides, it's basic strategy\Nto put the sun at your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.63,0:12:47.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sergeant!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.53,0:12:49.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The shot from the east is probably\Na decoy; there's no one there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.23,0:12:52.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If we're surrounded, we'd be getting more shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.43,0:12:55.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It may be that there is only one sniper.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.23,0:12:56.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How the hell can you be sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.43,0:12:59.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's what the situation indicates.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.73,0:13:00.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I have a suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.93,0:13:04.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll go over to your side after\Npassing through the east building.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.83,0:13:07.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I will signal you once I have\Nconfirmed that the building is empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.23,0:13:10.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Once I give the signal, everyone will fire\Nat will at the church and the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.03,0:13:13.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Use the opportunity to retrieve the\NCorporal and the tactical nuclear device.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.33,0:13:16.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Without it, we're stuck here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.53,0:13:19.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right, go with Snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.83,0:13:24.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Meeting up via a detour, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.83,0:13:27.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They'll know soon enough that there\Nis no one in the east building.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.93,0:13:29.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Before that happens...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.13,0:13:30.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll take out someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.83,0:13:36.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As we'd suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.36,0:13:54.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't move, Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.76,0:13:59.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There was no one, as we'd suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.76,0:14:02.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There was only one round, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.26,0:14:04.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's a smart one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.56,0:14:06.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But there is probably only one of him;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.66,0:14:07.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we'll get him with our superior numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.96,0:14:09.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right, the sniper is in the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.96,0:14:11.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll bring him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.23,0:14:13.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No, he could be in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.53,0:14:15.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even if we excluded the other abandoned buildings,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.43,0:14:18.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,because the jamming signal was cut\Nand we can't confirm a transmitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.43,0:14:19.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we can't totally dismiss the\Nhospital as a possible location.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.43,0:14:23.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How many metres away do you think the hospital is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.83,0:14:24.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's in the church!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.83,0:14:26.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How can you be sure?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.93,0:14:31.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's a sniper who challenges us while\Nmaking sure the GPS can't be used.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.43,0:14:33.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If he's a veteran fighter versed even\Nin the Coriolis effect,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.03,0:14:35.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we'll all get killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.03,0:14:38.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Too complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.23,0:14:39.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Who gives a damn which one it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.83,0:14:41.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.13,0:14:44.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Caution, not bravery, is the key to\Nsurvival on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.03,0:14:46.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Take a good look at that female gorilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.53,0:14:50.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's who you'd call a real pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.03,0:14:52.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"Female gorilla"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.85,0:14:57.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.82,0:15:03.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Pickles!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.72,0:15:04.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.83,0:15:08.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The enemy's in the hospital!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.33,0:15:09.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ishikawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.53,0:15:12.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.41,0:15:24.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In any case, we've retrieved the pod.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.81,0:15:26.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We were too late for the Corporal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.64,0:15:32.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right, let's retreat for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.64,0:15:34.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We can't all die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.04,0:15:36.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You're joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.24,0:15:37.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Pickles got killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.84,0:15:38.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We've gotta avenge him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.04,0:15:40.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's get the guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.24,0:15:41.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's an order!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.14,0:15:43.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We retreat now, and regroup!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.74,0:15:47.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A retreat is fine, but either way,\Nwe'll need to fight the sniper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.14,0:15:50.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We can't call for reinforcements as\Nlong as our comm systems are out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.64,0:15:52.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.14,0:15:54.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We still have the numerical advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.34,0:15:55.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.44,0:15:57.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Your buddies were killed, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.24,0:16:01.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.03,0:16:09.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.13,0:16:11.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They didn't panic. They're regrouping.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.83,0:16:13.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They must have a good commanding officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.83,0:16:20.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I realised that the final battle was drawing near.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.03,0:16:22.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The tension shot up,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.83,0:16:26.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and I could feel my adrenaline\Nlevel rising on a cellular level.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.23,0:16:31.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,When you kill each other on the battlefield,\Nyou can't tell who killed whom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.03,0:16:34.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But there is one exception to this rule,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.63,0:16:36.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and that would be snipers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.53,0:16:42.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The very act of sniping has a name attached to it from the outset.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.03,0:16:45.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's why snipers can't become POWs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.43,0:16:49.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As the hated enemy who killed their\Nbuddies and commanding officers,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.83,0:16:52.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,snipers are fated to be killed on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.79,0:17:00.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Once you put a recoilless round in\Nthere, pump it full of smoke rounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.59,0:17:02.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll mount an assault under cover of the smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.79,0:17:03.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.73,0:17:08.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Damn Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.45,0:17:17.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Okay, cover me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.05,0:17:19.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Snow and I will be in the assault!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.05,0:17:21.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Damn, I have to be backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.25,0:17:23.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Congrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.65,0:17:25.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You got her trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.32,0:17:28.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.99,0:17:34.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.69,0:17:37.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Leave the rest to the Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.39,0:17:38.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,She'll manage the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.39,0:17:40.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The "Major"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.89,0:17:43.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's up with her,\Nbeing called female gorilla and shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.19,0:17:44.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Who the hell is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.79,0:17:45.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.99,0:17:48.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But she's a genius at combat,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.89,0:17:52.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and we call her "Major".
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.93,0:18:34.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Upon confronting the Major, in that\Nmoment that was less than a second,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.13,0:18:37.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I imagined the conclusion\Nand felt a chill of fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.13,0:18:41.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It was a conclusion that my\Nexperience as a sniper arrived at
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.23,0:18:44.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,after considering all possible\Nvariables and circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.63,0:18:46.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"I will be killed."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.53,0:18:52.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,From her stance, the way she held the\Nrifle at her waist and didn't even blink,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.63,0:18:56.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I immediately understood that\Nshe was a complete cyborg.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.63,0:19:00.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In addition, her rifle was a\Nfull-sensing semi-automatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.13,0:19:05.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,She would then of course have targeting control\Nsystems for long, medium, and short ranges installed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.43,0:19:10.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I tried firing one shot at\Nthe Major in my imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.60,0:19:23.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The Major will shoot down my first shot;
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.60,0:19:28.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I, with my bolt action rifle, will get hit with her second\Nshot while trying to re-conceal myself behind the pillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.90,0:19:32.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No matter how many times I ran\Nthe simulation, it was the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.40,0:19:33.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But, but!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.30,0:19:34.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You couldn't let that situation continue!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.50,0:19:35.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.50,0:19:37.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If I had let the situation continue,\NI would've eventually been killed anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.20,0:19:42.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I desperately tried to think\Nof how I could turn the tables.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.13,0:19:45.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then, I noticed something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.83,0:19:50.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It was the jamming equipment\Nthat the Major first shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.73,0:19:54.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why did the Major destroy this first,\Neven using three shots to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.93,0:20:00.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"Wait, could it be that she doesn't have a\Nmedium-distance targeting software installed?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.13,0:20:02.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"Yes, that must be it."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.93,0:20:04.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"Even though she is a sniper,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.03,0:20:07.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,she had her full-sensing rifle use a short barrel."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.83,0:20:12.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"That is because she has decided to have the rifle\Nact as a sub-machine gun at medium distances."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.13,0:20:15.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"If so, to snipe at this medium distance,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.03,0:20:17.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,she needs the targeting software."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.93,0:20:23.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"Is she in the middle of downloading the\Ntargeting software from the satellite?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.04,0:20:43.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You have good skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.94,0:20:45.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Join my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.84,0:20:49.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,From the very beginning, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.03,0:20:58.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes, I was deceived by the Major's\Npoker face from the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.53,0:21:03.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I had no right to refuse;
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.13,0:21:08.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,that was her first order to me, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.73,0:21:16.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Deal me my last card.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.45,0:21:23.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That was an interesting story,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.15,0:21:25.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but it has nothing to do with this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.15,0:21:26.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm all in!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.29,0:21:30.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I call.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.49,0:21:32.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't play tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.19,0:21:36.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This time, you can't bluff your way through.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.09,0:21:39.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You're going for a royal flush of spades, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.99,0:21:42.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But you've got rags.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.79,0:21:48.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I know, because I have the ace of spades.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.99,0:21:51.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You have no chance of winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.19,0:21:54.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Besides, that story right\Nnow was a lie too, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.29,0:21:56.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it was an interesting story,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.19,0:21:59.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but there was an old movie that had a similar plot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.34,0:22:02.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.34,0:22:04.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I made it all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.14,0:22:07.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What? Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.89,0:22:16.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll let you guys go for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.99,0:22:18.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Azuma, cash me out, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.29,0:22:21.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Got embarrassed, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.99,0:22:24.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, rookie, I want it all in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.99,0:22:26.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You're one demanding senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.29,0:22:30.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I wonder if Saitou-San really had rags.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.70,0:22:35.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey everyone, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.10,0:22:39.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Saitou-San had a straight\Nflush with a nine of spades!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.50,0:22:40.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.14,0:22:48.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then, that story just now...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.04,0:22:50.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,could be true...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.54,0:22:53.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Could be...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.40,0:23:13.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Finding out a galaxy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.09,0:23:16.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,of planets and stars within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.77,0:23:19.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Listening to each of them
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.67,0:23:23.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,singing the same silent melody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.60,0:23:27.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've never seen such beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.70,0:23:30.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in possibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.99,0:23:34.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No smack of doubt or fear.
